<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x='adobe:ns:meta/' x:xmptk='Image::ExifTool 13.53'>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf='http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#'>

 <rdf:Description rdf:about=''
  xmlns:dc='http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/'>
  <dc:description>
   <rdf:Alt>
    <rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>A group of diverse business professionals, depicted as black silhouettes against a white background, are standing together in a staggered formation. The group includes both men and women, all dressed in formal business attire, such as suits and ties. Some individuals are holding briefcases, while others have their hands in their pockets or clasped. The silhouettes create a strong visual representation of a unified team, corporate environment, and professional collaboration.</rdf:li>
   </rdf:Alt>
  </dc:description>
  <dc:subject>
